(6544726, 973714, 82707, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love the creativity of this image.  I would have preferred a tighter crop.... I find the elements on the right and bottom, distracting from the  wine.</td>', 'Wow!  I love the creativity of this image.  I would have preferred a tighter crop.... I find the elements on the right and bottom, distracting from the  wine.', '2011-09-19 02:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
