(6544791, 974136, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely warm tones and a solid story telling (magazine like) image. I have a few bottles of Alexanderfontein in my cellar too, bought at the farm. I can see scoring issues for you with your horison appearing unleve due the angled POV l. Must be a South African. Rian? Stephen? Johann? Ammie? Hehe.</td>', 'Lovely warm tones and a solid story telling (magazine like) image. I have a few bottles of Alexanderfontein in my cellar too, bought at the farm. I can see scoring issues for you with your horison appearing unleve due the angled POV l. Must be a South African. Rian? Stephen? Johann? Ammie? Hehe.', '2011-09-19 03:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6544798, 973985, 108580, '<td valign="top">Classic Wine Magazine shot. Super "studio" work.</td>', 'Classic Wine Magazine shot. Super "studio" work.', '2011-09-19 03:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6544799, 974148, 108580, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and placement with the waterfall in OOF DOF. What gives me a feeling of imbalance however is the sandblasted writing on the glasses is obscured by reflections and the basket behind them.</td>', 'I like the shot and placement with the waterfall in OOF DOF. What gives me a feeling of imbalance however is the sandblasted writing on the glasses is obscured by reflections and the basket behind them.', '2011-09-19 03:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
