(6544811, 973948, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely high key image with select POI''s. Perhaps a bit too much light from the right as the finger nails blend with the fingers  and have lost definition. Still a front page contender.</td>', 'Lovely high key image with select POI''s. Perhaps a bit too much light from the right as the finger nails blend with the fingers  and have lost definition. Still a front page contender.', '2011-09-19 04:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
