(6544813, 973929, 108580, '<td valign="top">Clever and unique. Thoughtful work. Hope it doesn''t get targeted.</td>', 'Clever and unique. Thoughtful work. Hope it doesn''t get targeted.', '2011-09-19 04:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6544814, 973369, 113156, '<td valign="top">That eye is awesome, it''s  looking beyond.</td>', 'That eye is awesome, it''s  looking beyond.', '2011-09-19 04:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6544819, 973759, 108580, '<td valign="top">Classic Wine Magazine shot. Perfect lighting, reflections, clarity and DOF. Small niggle is the dust and hair on the wooden rail behind the bottle that you could no doubt have processed out in Advanced. Still a top shot. 8.</td>', 'Classic Wine Magazine shot. Perfect lighting, reflections, clarity and DOF. Small niggle is the dust and hair on the wooden rail behind the bottle that you could no doubt have processed out in Advanced. Still a top shot. 8.', '2011-09-19 04:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6544820, 974119, 108580, '<td valign="top">LOL super idea. Very creative. Just falls short in the sharpness department, i.e. the green bottle. But this could be attributed to the explosion :) Love the way the cork "splattered" on the glass. Cropped a bit too high though.<br/>Still I think it has the 0.5 second impact (pun intended) you sought and was no doubt technically difficult to pull off.</td>', 'LOL super idea. Very creative. Just falls short in the sharpness department, i.e. the green bottle. But this could be attributed to the explosion :) Love the way the cork "splattered" on the glass. Cropped a bit too high though.Still I think it has the 0.5 second impact (pun intended) you sought and was no doubt technically difficult to pull off.', '2011-09-19 04:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
