(6544872, 973999, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Nice work managing the exposure in what was probably very difficult conditions. Nice perspective and composition. Very well done.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Nice work managing the exposure in what was probably very difficult conditions. Nice perspective and composition. Very well done.', '2011-09-19 06:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6544882, 973733, 92953, '<td valign="top">Edge lightening is always my favorite, this image is pretty especially the wooden plank details. my take for the top, 10!</td>', 'Edge lightening is always my favorite, this image is pretty especially the wooden plank details. my take for the top, 10!', '2011-09-19 07:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6544883, 973791, 113156, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot lev, love the tones and relaxed atmosphere of this photo, great candid.</td>', 'Brilliant shot lev, love the tones and relaxed atmosphere of this photo, great candid.', '2011-09-19 07:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6544886, 974009, 108580, '<td valign="top">Off course this idea has been done before. Fine. No issues. You have rich fabric, a suggestively shapely...wine glass and model and good lighting however the composition is not great. I''d have placed her more to her left and accordingly the bottle and glass avoiding the irritating sudden end of table and cloth. My preference. Others may not even notice it :)</td>', 'Off course this idea has been done before. Fine. No issues. You have rich fabric, a suggestively shapely...wine glass and model and good lighting however the composition is not great. I''d have placed her more to her left and accordingly the bottle and glass avoiding the irritating sudden end of table and cloth. My preference. Others may not even notice it :)', '2011-09-19 07:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6544890, 973841, 108580, '<td valign="top">Good still life. Has all the right elements, light, colour, props, even an odd broken granite cutting board. Pity about the awful dark shade blotch on the table cloth bottom left.</td>', 'Good still life. Has all the right elements, light, colour, props, even an odd broken granite cutting board. Pity about the awful dark shade blotch on the table cloth bottom left.', '2011-09-19 07:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6544891, 973939, 108580, '<td valign="top">Naturally the style is recognisable as is the alleyway and the crisp b&amp;w processing unless you now have a copy cat :) Great work and an eye for detail. Being France I guess a baguette and a slab of Brie or Camembert in the basket would not have been out of place ;p</td>', 'Naturally the style is recognisable as is the alleyway and the crisp b&w processing unless you now have a copy cat :) Great work and an eye for detail. Being France I guess a baguette and a slab of Brie or Camembert in the basket would not have been out of place ;p', '2011-09-19 07:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
