(6545666, 974014, 16106, '<td valign="top">Im not a fan of the all too common wine glass swirling around a glass mid pour, back lit, with neither stem of glass nor wine bottle showing. I''ve seen it many times before, and was afraid I would see it again and again in this challenge.  This is one of those, except it is much better than any other I have ever seen. The fluid is so dynamic and the shapes you got are beautiful, complex and unique. <br/> <br/>Taking a tired idea and making it come alive is an impressive feat. My pick for blue.</td>', 'Im not a fan of the all too common wine glass swirling around a glass mid pour, back lit, with neither stem of glass nor wine bottle showing. I''ve seen it many times before, and was afraid I would see it again and again in this challenge.  This is one of those, except it is much better than any other I have ever seen. The fluid is so dynamic and the shapes you got are beautiful, complex and unique.  Taking a tired idea and making it come alive is an impressive feat. My pick for blue.', '2011-09-19 21:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
