(6546135, 973957, 12611, '<td valign="top">love that vista. great diagonal line of the glasses; great use of color.</td>', 'love that vista. great diagonal line of the glasses; great use of color.', '2011-09-20 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546136, 973939, 12611, '<td valign="top">Looks like the stone Streets of Jagar with another wonderful slice of life. Even if its not, its a very silvery black and white shot, a good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like the stone Streets of Jagar with another wonderful slice of life. Even if its not, its a very silvery black and white shot, a good take on the challenge.', '2011-09-20 15:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546138, 973779, 80831, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea! 9</td>', 'Very cool idea! 9', '2011-09-20 15:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546159, 973733, 101702, '<td valign="top">Love the processing. Looks like an amazing place :-)</td>', 'Love the processing. Looks like an amazing place :-)', '2011-09-20 16:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546163, 973733, 113591, '<td valign="top">Jip, this should be on the front page. Perfect PP''ing</td>', 'Jip, this should be on the front page. Perfect PP''ing', '2011-09-20 16:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546199, 974014, 66384, '<td valign="top">The subject and composition are screaming 6. But it''s definitely worth a higher vote than that. Hope that subliminal message doesn''t hurt your overall score.</td>', 'The subject and composition are screaming 6. But it''s definitely worth a higher vote than that. Hope that subliminal message doesn''t hurt your overall score.', '2011-09-20 18:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546200, 973369, 66384, '<td valign="top">Haunting.</td>', 'Haunting.', '2011-09-20 18:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546201, 974091, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice still life. Well lit and beautifully arranged. It deserves a higher quality glass.</td>', 'Nice still life. Well lit and beautifully arranged. It deserves a higher quality glass.', '2011-09-20 18:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546204, 974087, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of this duotone treatment, although I can see why you used it -- there is really too much in this image, and the foreground is not well separated from the background. Perhaps a shallower DOF would have helped.</td>', 'I''m not fond of this duotone treatment, although I can see why you used it -- there is really too much in this image, and the foreground is not well separated from the background. Perhaps a shallower DOF would have helped.', '2011-09-20 18:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546208, 973870, 66384, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the pearly cloth. For me, the dirty glass in the front spoils the beauty of this image. Still, it is well composed and lit. I think I would like it better if the glasses were in reverse order, with the very attractive grapes in the front.</td>', 'I particularly like the pearly cloth. For me, the dirty glass in the front spoils the beauty of this image. Still, it is well composed and lit. I think I would like it better if the glasses were in reverse order, with the very attractive grapes in the front.', '2011-09-20 18:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546209, 973437, 66384, '<td valign="top">Seems a little busy with too much competing for attention: the rocks in the table, the bricks in the hearth, all the medals and ribbons and the yellow wall.</td>', 'Seems a little busy with too much competing for attention: the rocks in the table, the bricks in the hearth, all the medals and ribbons and the yellow wall.', '2011-09-20 18:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546210, 973929, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the humor in this, as well as the good advice. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the humor in this, as well as the good advice. Nicely done.', '2011-09-20 18:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546213, 973316, 66384, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the way the bottle and it''s shadow interplay. They create an elegant design.</td>', 'I particularly like the way the bottle and it''s shadow interplay. They create an elegant design.', '2011-09-20 18:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546214, 973779, 138557, '<td valign="top">I can see this photo as a cover for Desperate Housewives.</td>', 'I can see this photo as a cover for Desperate Housewives.', '2011-09-20 18:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546215, 974058, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice simplicity and elegance. I love the rich color.</td>', 'Nice simplicity and elegance. I love the rich color.', '2011-09-20 18:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546216, 973940, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice blend of color between the subject and background.</td>', 'Nice blend of color between the subject and background.', '2011-09-20 18:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546226, 973791, 66384, '<td valign="top">The cigarette and wine are not very good partners, IMO. Wine should be savored, that''s hard to do with the overpowering taste and smell of the cigarette. But I realize some people drink wine for the effect rather than the taste and bouquet. All in all, though, this is a nice street scene..</td>', 'The cigarette and wine are not very good partners, IMO. Wine should be savored, that''s hard to do with the overpowering taste and smell of the cigarette. But I realize some people drink wine for the effect rather than the taste and bouquet. All in all, though, this is a nice street scene..', '2011-09-20 19:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546229, 974003, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice simplicity, lighting, and warm tone.</td>', 'Nice simplicity, lighting, and warm tone.', '2011-09-20 19:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546237, 973893, 59796, '<td valign="top">Great evening light! And nicely balanced composition - the sky matches the red soil in form too.<br/>However, the red of the soil is overpowering everything else in the shot I think. A crop off the bottom of the pic or reducing the red saturation a bit would probably get the viewer to focus more on the rest of the vineyard scene.</td>', 'Great evening light! And nicely balanced composition - the sky matches the red soil in form too.However, the red of the soil is overpowering everything else in the shot I think. A crop off the bottom of the pic or reducing the red saturation a bit would probably get the viewer to focus more on the rest of the vineyard scene.', '2011-09-20 19:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546239, 973932, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Love the subtle colors in this still life. <br/>Given the warm colors in the scene, the white flash light is a little glaring (especially the white flash reflection in the wine glass). Maybe a yellow gel in front of the flash would''ve made it blend in better?</td>', 'Nicely done! Love the subtle colors in this still life. Given the warm colors in the scene, the white flash light is a little glaring (especially the white flash reflection in the wine glass). Maybe a yellow gel in front of the flash would''ve made it blend in better?', '2011-09-20 19:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546240, 973754, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful varying shades of green. Wish they didn''t have the fence :) Given that it''s advanced editing, you could''ve safely cloned out the orange pole standing in the middle I think.</td>', 'Beautiful varying shades of green. Wish they didn''t have the fence :) Given that it''s advanced editing, you could''ve safely cloned out the orange pole standing in the middle I think.', '2011-09-20 19:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546241, 973920, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful bubbles. The color stands out well against the cool background as well. <br/>The crop is a bit odd though - I would''ve either liked a closer crop of just the bubbles and the pouring wine, or a farther crop showing the full glass. The cutoff rims are a bit distracting for me.</td>', 'Wonderful bubbles. The color stands out well against the cool background as well. The crop is a bit odd though - I would''ve either liked a closer crop of just the bubbles and the pouring wine, or a farther crop showing the full glass. The cutoff rims are a bit distracting for me.', '2011-09-20 19:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546242, 973841, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice still life. Very tempting too :)<br/>Would''ve preferred a warmer flash tone (yellow gel?) to blend better with the nice warm colors of the food. The white flash makes the food a little less appetizing.</td>', 'Nice still life. Very tempting too :)Would''ve preferred a warmer flash tone (yellow gel?) to blend better with the nice warm colors of the food. The white flash makes the food a little less appetizing.', '2011-09-20 19:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546244, 974088, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice warm lighting on this one - matching the warm tones of the scene itself. Would''ve liked a teeny bit more exposure I think - right now it doesn''t quite fit in as low-key. Still, I like the scene quite a bit.</td>', 'Nice warm lighting on this one - matching the warm tones of the scene itself. Would''ve liked a teeny bit more exposure I think - right now it doesn''t quite fit in as low-key. Still, I like the scene quite a bit.', '2011-09-20 19:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546245, 974106, 59796, '<td valign="top">Hope you aren''t getting too hammered on the scoring.<br/>As I found out the hard way, DPC considers drop shots a cliche, and scores them down quite a bit. To fare well with drop shots here, the quality has to be extraordinary. Here''s a shot that''s done well for instance (just to give you an idea): <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=830224" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1104/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_830224.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1104/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_830224.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1104/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_830224.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Hope you aren''t getting too hammered on the scoring.As I found out the hard way, DPC considers drop shots a cliche, and scores them down quite a bit. To fare well with drop shots here, the quality has to be extraordinary. Here''s a shot that''s done well for instance (just to give you an idea): ', '2011-09-20 19:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546246, 973513, 59796, '<td valign="top">Love the goblets! <br/>However, the colorful background is very distracting and doesn''t add much to the scene - it just competes for attention. <br/>Also, am not sure if this a HDR, but that lack of shadows makes the dimples on the glass look flat and cheap. Usually, such texture benefits from non-uniform lighting and the shadows it casts.</td>', 'Love the goblets! However, the colorful background is very distracting and doesn''t add much to the scene - it just competes for attention. Also, am not sure if this a HDR, but that lack of shadows makes the dimples on the glass look flat and cheap. Usually, such texture benefits from non-uniform lighting and the shadows it casts.', '2011-09-20 19:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546252, 973953, 59796, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Nice soft lighting to go with it.<br/>The light green background is probably not the best idea - doesn''t make the wine look appetizing. A warm, subtle color or black might''ve done a better job I think.</td>', 'Good idea. Nice soft lighting to go with it.The light green background is probably not the best idea - doesn''t make the wine look appetizing. A warm, subtle color or black might''ve done a better job I think.', '2011-09-20 20:04:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6546253, 974014, 59796, '<td valign="top">lol - nice title to go with a wonderful pic. I can almost hear the yell - "Waaaiiiiteeeerrrrrr!!!" <br/>Very nicely lit stop motion shot. Love the pattern of the wine that escaped. <br/> <br/>The border is not my cup of tea though - very distracting.</td>', 'lol - nice title to go with a wonderful pic. I can almost hear the yell - "Waaaiiiiteeeerrrrrr!!!" Very nicely lit stop motion shot. Love the pattern of the wine that escaped.  The border is not my cup of tea though - very distracting.', '2011-09-20 20:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546276, 973770, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and light, so well melded.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and light, so well melded.', '2011-09-20 20:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546293, 974127, 66384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. Hard to get such clarity in a shadow. Love the way you used the drizzles paint to get the effect of a scratched overlay. I don''t understand the significance of the chain, but it definitely adds to the composition and mystery.</td>', 'Brilliant. Hard to get such clarity in a shadow. Love the way you used the drizzles paint to get the effect of a scratched overlay. I don''t understand the significance of the chain, but it definitely adds to the composition and mystery.', '2011-09-20 20:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546303, 974103, 66384, '<td valign="top">Fine art, not eye candy. I hope it does well.</td>', 'Fine art, not eye candy. I hope it does well.', '2011-09-20 20:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546306, 974010, 66384, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the background.</td>', 'I particularly like the background.', '2011-09-20 20:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546307, 973747, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and light, so well melded.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and light, so well melded.', '2011-09-20 20:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546308, 973837, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! I can see this as a printed advertisement - the caption suits it perfectly as well.</td>', 'Nicely done! I can see this as a printed advertisement - the caption suits it perfectly as well.', '2011-09-20 20:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546313, 974125, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Love the decanter. The background and lighting are fabulous. <br/>I can see some colored specks on the glasses that are noticeable on the subtle background.</td>', 'Very nice! Love the decanter. The background and lighting are fabulous. I can see some colored specks on the glasses that are noticeable on the subtle background.', '2011-09-20 20:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546319, 974149, 66384, '<td valign="top">Elegant.</td>', 'Elegant.', '2011-09-20 21:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546320, 974081, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love it!,,</td>', 'Love it!,,', '2011-09-20 21:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546323, 973779, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! I''m guessing Frozen/Jello in the glass, stuck to the table and inverted? Nice idea well executed. Great lighting and a funny title :)<br/>The only thing keeping this from being perfect is that the table curve is not symmetric around the wine glass.</td>', 'Nicely done! I''m guessing Frozen/Jello in the glass, stuck to the table and inverted? Nice idea well executed. Great lighting and a funny title :)The only thing keeping this from being perfect is that the table curve is not symmetric around the wine glass.', '2011-09-20 21:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546326, 973957, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and contrast. I like the negative space. Very strong image.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and contrast. I like the negative space. Very strong image.', '2011-09-20 21:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546327, 973778, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, Good lighting, Seamless background - well done.<br/> <br/>The inner layer of glasses was unnecessary I think - Given the angle of the shot, they are not easily distinguishable, and are just confusing the clean lines of the outer layer of glasses.<br/>The reflection is double-layered and jarring. I''m guessing you used a glass mirror instead of plastic/plexi?</td>', 'Nice idea, Good lighting, Seamless background - well done. The inner layer of glasses was unnecessary I think - Given the angle of the shot, they are not easily distinguishable, and are just confusing the clean lines of the outer layer of glasses.The reflection is double-layered and jarring. I''m guessing you used a glass mirror instead of plastic/plexi?', '2011-09-20 21:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546329, 973770, 59796, '<td valign="top">Such beautiful decanter and goblets! And shot in such wonderful soft backlight! Love the muted colors - fabulous shot!</td>', 'Such beautiful decanter and goblets! And shot in such wonderful soft backlight! Love the muted colors - fabulous shot!', '2011-09-20 21:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546331, 973779, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very clever, and stops the viewer for a while. I would like it better with a different background. I don''t think gray enhances the image.</td>', 'Very clever, and stops the viewer for a while. I would like it better with a different background. I don''t think gray enhances the image.', '2011-09-20 21:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546333, 973714, 66384, '<td valign="top">deLIGHTful.</td>', 'deLIGHTful.', '2011-09-20 21:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546361, 974125, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful form, and great background. Love the colors.</td>', 'Beautiful form, and great background. Love the colors.', '2011-09-20 21:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546362, 973632, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice design.</td>', 'Very nice design.', '2011-09-20 21:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546366, 974089, 66384, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF. Lovely lighting.</td>', 'Perfect DOF. Lovely lighting.', '2011-09-20 21:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546370, 973932, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and clarity. I think the placement of the candle is not ideal -- it cuts the image in half. Actually, I think it would be an excellent composition without the candle.</td>', 'Lovely colors and clarity. I think the placement of the candle is not ideal -- it cuts the image in half. Actually, I think it would be an excellent composition without the candle.', '2011-09-20 21:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546371, 973677, 122943, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image very sharp.</td>', 'Nice clean image very sharp.', '2011-09-20 21:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546382, 974088, 66384, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for me. Very nice arrangement, but I can hardly see the wine and glass, and the grapes are dull. I think all it needs is a slight boost in brightness to make it really pop.</td>', 'A little too dark for me. Very nice arrangement, but I can hardly see the wine and glass, and the grapes are dull. I think all it needs is a slight boost in brightness to make it really pop.', '2011-09-20 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546399, 974137, 66384, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a breakfast with fiber. Looks very Southwestern with those colors.</td>', 'Now that''s a breakfast with fiber. Looks very Southwestern with those colors.', '2011-09-20 21:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546404, 974080, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love all the arcs and circles. Great Simplicity of design.</td>', 'Love all the arcs and circles. Great Simplicity of design.', '2011-09-20 21:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546406, 974120, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! I can''t figure out how in the world you achieved this!! Amazing!<br/>Love the lighting, the seamless background, the colors, the crispness, the improbability of it all. Very well done.</td>', 'Wow! I can''t figure out how in the world you achieved this!! Amazing!Love the lighting, the seamless background, the colors, the crispness, the improbability of it all. Very well done.', '2011-09-20 22:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546408, 973939, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very nice! A unique take on the challenge. Quite some guts to take a B/W shot and title it "The <b>RED</b> Bike" :)<br/>Would''ve been better without the cable lock on the bike I think - lol</td>', 'Very nice! A unique take on the challenge. Quite some guts to take a B/W shot and title it "The RED Bike" :)Would''ve been better without the cable lock on the bike I think - lol', '2011-09-20 22:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546410, 973648, 59796, '<td valign="top">Oh no! You''re spilling it!!!! Sigh! The things we do for photography :P<br/>Wonderful back lighting and good stop action. <br/>Would''ve been perfect if you placed the glasses on plastic/plexi. The glass mirror just gives double reflections and makes all the spilt wine look jarring.</td>', 'Oh no! You''re spilling it!!!! Sigh! The things we do for photography :PWonderful back lighting and good stop action. Would''ve been perfect if you placed the glasses on plastic/plexi. The glass mirror just gives double reflections and makes all the spilt wine look jarring.', '2011-09-20 22:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546412, 974129, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is going to cause some seizures. Really trippy.</td>', 'This is going to cause some seizures. Really trippy.', '2011-09-20 22:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546413, 973948, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very cool high key image. Great composition too.<br/>The flat/even lighting doesn''t flatter the person though. Wish there was a teeny bit of shadow to one side to add some dimension to the pic.</td>', 'Very cool high key image. Great composition too.The flat/even lighting doesn''t flatter the person though. Wish there was a teeny bit of shadow to one side to add some dimension to the pic.', '2011-09-20 22:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546415, 973780, 59796, '<td valign="top">Love the still life! Great lighting too - soft and warm - fits the scene well.<br/>If there were no light reflections in the goblet, this would be perfect!</td>', 'Love the still life! Great lighting too - soft and warm - fits the scene well.If there were no light reflections in the goblet, this would be perfect!', '2011-09-20 22:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546417, 973872, 66384, '<td valign="top">Excellent effect, and I love the color.  Somebody better take control of those keys.</td>', 'Excellent effect, and I love the color.  Somebody better take control of those keys.', '2011-09-20 22:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546418, 973985, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice still life! Could''ve benefited more from a warm lighting - making the food more appetizing - than the soft white flash light I think.</td>', 'Nice still life! Could''ve benefited more from a warm lighting - making the food more appetizing - than the soft white flash light I think.', '2011-09-20 22:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546419, 974009, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice Risque shot :) Good concept, well lit too.<br/>Would''ve liked it even more if the thigh gap lined up perfectly with the wine glass stem - right now it''s immediately noticeable.</td>', 'Nice Risque shot :) Good concept, well lit too.Would''ve liked it even more if the thigh gap lined up perfectly with the wine glass stem - right now it''s immediately noticeable.', '2011-09-20 22:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546420, 973697, 66384, '<td valign="top">Yummy colors, and I like all the wonderful curves. Very exciting.</td>', 'Yummy colors, and I like all the wonderful curves. Very exciting.', '2011-09-20 22:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546422, 973951, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the muted pallet. Beautiful image and statement.</td>', 'Love the muted pallet. Beautiful image and statement.', '2011-09-20 22:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546423, 974045, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and Interesting processing! Has that soft/dreamy look to it. While that treatment is awesome on the wine bottle and the grapes, the bread doesn''t look too appetizing though. Curious border too - first time I''m seeing that one - seems to work well in this case.</td>', 'Nice lighting and Interesting processing! Has that soft/dreamy look to it. While that treatment is awesome on the wine bottle and the grapes, the bread doesn''t look too appetizing though. Curious border too - first time I''m seeing that one - seems to work well in this case.', '2011-09-20 22:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546424, 973943, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Interesting choice of crop - I would''ve probably done full bottles myself, to let colors take up more of the picture than white. But this seems to work just fine.</td>', 'Very cool! Interesting choice of crop - I would''ve probably done full bottles myself, to let colors take up more of the picture than white. But this seems to work just fine.', '2011-09-20 22:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546430, 974129, 59796, '<td valign="top">Psychedelic! <br/>The choice of background patterns, the zoom, the glaringly obvious subject - what an interesting experiment that worked! Very unique!</td>', 'Psychedelic! The choice of background patterns, the zoom, the glaringly obvious subject - what an interesting experiment that worked! Very unique!', '2011-09-20 22:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546432, 974146, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful concept and title! I didn''t know who Dionysus was, and looked him up. <br/>A little too high-key though - would''ve been good to see a bit more definition of the wine glass I think.</td>', 'Beautiful concept and title! I didn''t know who Dionysus was, and looked him up. A little too high-key though - would''ve been good to see a bit more definition of the wine glass I think.', '2011-09-20 22:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546435, 974126, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful concept nicely executed. Unfortunate placement of light reflection near her derrier :( Given that it''s advanced editing, you could''ve edited that one out and it would''ve been perfect! Still, one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful concept nicely executed. Unfortunate placement of light reflection near her derrier :( Given that it''s advanced editing, you could''ve edited that one out and it would''ve been perfect! Still, one of the best in this challenge.', '2011-09-20 22:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546436, 974082, 29777, '<td valign="top">I really like the blur in this shot.</td>', 'I really like the blur in this shot.', '2011-09-20 22:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546439, 974058, 29777, '<td valign="top">too dark. It looks like there may be some motion in the wine, but hard to tell.</td>', 'too dark. It looks like there may be some motion in the wine, but hard to tell.', '2011-09-20 22:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546441, 974125, 29777, '<td valign="top">excellent control of reflections</td>', 'excellent control of reflections', '2011-09-20 22:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546444, 973525, 128201, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, very different from many of the other images. Layout is also very nice, looks like just another morning breakfast. My only complaint is the lighting. It''s a little harsh in areas which cause distracting shadows. The glare off the tile also draws the eye away from the subject.<br/> <br/>Not that this detracts from the image but of all the people I know that might be considered wine aficionados, none of them would get anywhere near boxed wine :)<br/> <br/>Now the big question, did you eat the cereal?<br/> <br/>Not voting on this one, I recognize the face and want to keep the votes unbiased.</td>', 'I love the idea, very different from many of the other images. Layout is also very nice, looks like just another morning breakfast. My only complaint is the lighting. It''s a little harsh in areas which cause distracting shadows. The glare off the tile also draws the eye away from the subject. Not that this detracts from the image but of all the people I know that might be considered wine aficionados, none of them would get anywhere near boxed wine :) Now the big question, did you eat the cereal? Not voting on this one, I recognize the face and want to keep the votes unbiased.', '2011-09-20 22:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
