(6548041, 973954, 10785, '<td valign="top">A somewhat candid image. The subject was caught peeking at the camera here. The lighting from the advertisement creates a nice diffuse light but the subject needs a little separation from it because there is light "spillover". Good color but could probably use a bit more contrast.</td>', 'A somewhat candid image. The subject was caught peeking at the camera here. The lighting from the advertisement creates a nice diffuse light but the subject needs a little separation from it because there is light "spillover". Good color but could probably use a bit more contrast.', '2011-09-22 10:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6548043, 974014, 10785, '<td valign="top">I am not fond of the double border you have here. It would be ok if it were just on the horizontal, but to have the red line on the vertical really chops the photo. I like the red color and the gradient background. I feel the wine flying up and out of the cup at the top is somewhat cut off and hurts the composition. Great stop action though!</td>', 'I am not fond of the double border you have here. It would be ok if it were just on the horizontal, but to have the red line on the vertical really chops the photo. I like the red color and the gradient background. I feel the wine flying up and out of the cup at the top is somewhat cut off and hurts the composition. Great stop action though!', '2011-09-22 10:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6548047, 974120, 10785, '<td valign="top">Where''s Art''s stamp??? I actually feel the lighting is a bit off on the background and the brightest part of the gradient should be moved higher up the image instead of behind the glass stems.</td>', 'Where''s Art''s stamp??? I actually feel the lighting is a bit off on the background and the brightest part of the gradient should be moved higher up the image instead of behind the glass stems.', '2011-09-22 10:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6548050, 973747, 10785, '<td valign="top">I am assuming this was shot with the lensbaby. I am just not sure the selective focus added anything here. The lensbaby blur delivers a lot of motion to the image and I don''t think it works here. It''s a good set up though and you got the focus point at the right spot. Unfortunately there is also a line of light right through the subject focal point.</td>', 'I am assuming this was shot with the lensbaby. I am just not sure the selective focus added anything here. The lensbaby blur delivers a lot of motion to the image and I don''t think it works here. It''s a good set up though and you got the focus point at the right spot. Unfortunately there is also a line of light right through the subject focal point.', '2011-09-22 10:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
