(6549758, 974091, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the light wasn''t so direct.  It looks like on-camera flash to me.  I think the grapes and the leaves could have benefited from more directional lighting.</td>', 'I wish the light wasn''t so direct.  It looks like on-camera flash to me.  I think the grapes and the leaves could have benefited from more directional lighting.', '2011-09-24 08:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6549764, 974078, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement of the subjects, but I don''t like the yellow-y tungsten white balance.  I think that having so many reflections in the bottle is distracting, and the use of ceiling lighting doesn''t provide the most flattering angle of light on the subjects.  The centered composition works great for the subject, but I don''t think this has the attention to detail that I''ve seen in some of the other images in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the arrangement of the subjects, but I don''t like the yellow-y tungsten white balance.  I think that having so many reflections in the bottle is distracting, and the use of ceiling lighting doesn''t provide the most flattering angle of light on the subjects.  The centered composition works great for the subject, but I don''t think this has the attention to detail that I''ve seen in some of the other images in the challenge.', '2011-09-24 09:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6549766, 973951, 47470, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the location, but the reflection of your funny photog''s pose killed the mood for me.</td>', 'I absolutely love the location, but the reflection of your funny photog''s pose killed the mood for me.', '2011-09-24 09:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
