(6551208, 974009, 75713, '<td valign="top">I gave credit to it in my remarks .. there was no mention of who the photographer was .. De Sousa''s is not original either as it was done before.  I hope he credited the originator of the composition.  I don''t know his work and he has no portfolio.  Mine wasn''t a subtle joke .. it was a just a fun shot based on a photo who''s source I included in my remarks ... did every wine, cheese and bread shot get the same remark.. they have been done before?  Did every wine glass shot get dinged in votes because of other shots of wine glasses?  <br/> <br/>Some one should tell De Sousa''s his shot is being ripped off - if you Google wine, his shot comes up on the first page of a site called Just Glass with NO photographers name listed.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-09-26 09:42:58.</i></td>', 'I gave credit to it in my remarks .. there was no mention of who the photographer was .. De Sousa''s is not original either as it was done before.  I hope he credited the originator of the composition.  I don''t know his work and he has no portfolio.  Mine wasn''t a subtle joke .. it was a just a fun shot based on a photo who''s source I included in my remarks ... did every wine, cheese and bread shot get the same remark.. they have been done before?  Did every wine glass shot get dinged in votes because of other shots of wine glasses?   Some one should tell De Sousa''s his shot is being ripped off - if you Google wine, his shot comes up on the first page of a site called Just Glass with NO photographers name listed.  ', '2011-09-26 02:00:30.000000', '2011-09-26 10:42:58.000000', 0),
