(6551438, 974136, 114233, '<td valign="top">A lovely setting and the warm fire adds to the mood.<br/>I know still life shots arent your normal type of shot - [robably a few minor tweaks would have helped to get the votes a bit higher:<br/>The table and BG seem to be at a bit of an angle and not straight on to the camera, The white balance is nice and warm - probably done on purpose but maybe nudge it a bit towards a whiter setting, the background looks a little cluttered and distracting. <br/>An even more minor nit pick - most fly fishermen seem to be whiskey drinkers...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-09-26 08:19:38.</i></td>', 'A lovely setting and the warm fire adds to the mood.I know still life shots arent your normal type of shot - [robably a few minor tweaks would have helped to get the votes a bit higher:The table and BG seem to be at a bit of an angle and not straight on to the camera, The white balance is nice and warm - probably done on purpose but maybe nudge it a bit towards a whiter setting, the background looks a little cluttered and distracting. An even more minor nit pick - most fly fishermen seem to be whiskey drinkers...', '2011-09-26 06:46:32.000000', '2011-09-26 09:19:38.000000', 0),
