(6551926, 973990, 90495, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I''ve been looking for a similar scene of farmland in my area for years. <br/> <br/>I just love images that take you on a visual voyage like this one. <br/> <br/>Who''s the idiot who gave you a 1 vote? What a sour-puss. I figure this was from a HDR hater thinking this was processed with HDR software.</td>', 'Great shot. I''ve been looking for a similar scene of farmland in my area for years.  I just love images that take you on a visual voyage like this one.  Who''s the idiot who gave you a 1 vote? What a sour-puss. I figure this was from a HDR hater thinking this was processed with HDR software.', '2011-09-26 18:14:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6551934, 974091, 90495, '<td valign="top">When I photograph glass I try not to light it up with a flash. I rather bounce light off a white background onto the glass. To light up the grapes use the light that is being bounced off the background and reflect it back to your grapes with foamboard or whatever you use. This light will be very diffused and will cast less shadows and highlights, perfect for grapes. <br/> <br/></td>', 'When I photograph glass I try not to light it up with a flash. I rather bounce light off a white background onto the glass. To light up the grapes use the light that is being bounced off the background and reflect it back to your grapes with foamboard or whatever you use. This light will be very diffused and will cast less shadows and highlights, perfect for grapes.  ', '2011-09-26 18:21:16.000000', NULL, 0),
